    "name": "Liquid Peak: Offroad",
    "steam_appid": 3801990,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liquid Peak: Offroad\u00a0is a calm, focused game about offroad driving and real-time terrain sculpting. It challenges you to create and conquer a growing chain of rugged landscapes. You begin with a floating hill. Place the next piece. Shape the terrain. Drive the trail. Try to drive across the path you\u2019ve built and climbs skyward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/2207f77d9a1c3dd2169911ce80479caf.poster.avif?t=1753261780\" width=596 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/2207f77d9a1c3dd2169911ce80479caf.webm?t=1753261780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/2207f77d9a1c3dd2169911ce80479caf.mp4?t=1753261780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive across tight paths, brutal obstacles, and master hill climbs. Every turn tests your control, balance, and terrain-reading instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/8fd315a6c064f18b7c19eac5b1cede0e.poster.avif?t=1753261780\" width=596 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/8fd315a6c064f18b7c19eac5b1cede0e.webm?t=1753261780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/8fd315a6c064f18b7c19eac5b1cede0e.mp4?t=1753261780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the deformable voxel terrain, build bridge and adjust slopes in real time to ensure your trail flows. It is actually driveable, even when heading uphill \u2014 think strategy before you drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/9a0ffff235c8bec1e8649609ad84c065.poster.avif?t=1753261780\" width=596 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/9a0ffff235c8bec1e8649609ad84c065.webm?t=1753261780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/9a0ffff235c8bec1e8649609ad84c065.mp4?t=1753261780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel your weight. Collide with dynamic voxel terrain. You\u2019ll really sink \u2014 and watch out for falling stones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Minimalism</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pure, stylized world with soft lighting and natural ambiance that keeps your focus on terrain and trail.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liquid Peak: Offroad\u00a0is a calm, focused game about offroad driving and real-time terrain sculpting. It challenges you to create and conquer a growing chain of rugged landscapes. You begin with a floating hill. Place the next piece. Shape the terrain. Drive the trail. Try to drive across the path you\u2019ve built and climbs skyward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/2207f77d9a1c3dd2169911ce80479caf.poster.avif?t=1753261780\" width=596 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/2207f77d9a1c3dd2169911ce80479caf.webm?t=1753261780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/2207f77d9a1c3dd2169911ce80479caf.mp4?t=1753261780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive across tight paths, brutal obstacles, and master hill climbs. Every turn tests your control, balance, and terrain-reading instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/8fd315a6c064f18b7c19eac5b1cede0e.poster.avif?t=1753261780\" width=596 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/8fd315a6c064f18b7c19eac5b1cede0e.webm?t=1753261780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/8fd315a6c064f18b7c19eac5b1cede0e.mp4?t=1753261780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the deformable voxel terrain, build bridge and adjust slopes in real time to ensure your trail flows. It is actually driveable, even when heading uphill \u2014 think strategy before you drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/9a0ffff235c8bec1e8649609ad84c065.poster.avif?t=1753261780\" width=596 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/9a0ffff235c8bec1e8649609ad84c065.webm?t=1753261780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/extras/9a0ffff235c8bec1e8649609ad84c065.mp4?t=1753261780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel your weight. Collide with dynamic voxel terrain. You\u2019ll really sink \u2014 and watch out for falling stones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Minimalism</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pure, stylized world with soft lighting and natural ambiance that keeps your focus on terrain and trail.</p>",
    "short_description": "Liquid Peak: Offroad is a peaceful offroad game where you sculpt terrain to build your own floating roads. Link each hill, shape the deformable voxel terrain, follow the path you\u2019ve built and climb skyward. Push your creativity and driving skills to the limit.",
